    "document": "Event Companion",
    "section": "Event Companion",
    "summary": "Board A of the Singles Event Companion is for Reconnaissance against Priority Assets. The Reconnaissance player plays Search and Scour and the Priority Assets player plays Vanguard Operation. The app pairs this board with the Crucible Of Battle deployment. Neither disposition fixes the Attacker or Defender role; a roll-off settles that. Every zone, territory, objective and terrain position comes only from the official board image, and this entry states no measurements. Its lettered terrain pieces refer to the parts of the Battlefields: Armageddon kit.",
